lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/iluwatar/java-design-patterns&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;java-design-patterns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;94.8k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;27.3k&lt;br&gt;Design patterns implemented in Java&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/metersphere/metersphere&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;metersphere&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;13.6k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;2.8k&lt;br&gt;MeterSphere 是新一代的开源持续测试工具，内置 AI 助手，让软件测试工作更简单、更高效，不再成为持续交付的瓶颈。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/halo-sigs/halo-gradle-plugin&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;halo-gradle-plugin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;11 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;8&lt;br&gt;Plugin devtools For developing Halo plugin&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Hi there, I&#39;m GuQing 👋&lt;/h1&gt; 
&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; 
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/guqing&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/github/followers/guqing?style=social&quot; alt=&quot;GitHub followers&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://guqing.io&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-guqing.io-blue&quot; alt=&quot;Website&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:i@guqing.email&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Email-i@guqing.email-red&quot; alt=&quot;Email&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Full-Stack Engineer | Open Source Enthusiast | Core Maintainer @ Halo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
 &lt;p&gt;📍 Chengdu, China • 🌐 &lt;a href=&quot;https://guqing.io&quot;&gt;guqing.io&lt;/a&gt; • 🏆 GitHub Top 6% Contributor&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;hr /&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 About Me&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🏗️ &lt;strong&gt;Core Architect&lt;/strong&gt; of &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/halo-dev/halo&quot;&gt;Halo 2.0&lt;/a&gt; (37K+ ⭐, 20K+ users), leading the complete rewrite from scratch&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of open source contribution experience&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;6 years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional full-stack development experience&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;📊 &lt;strong&gt;722 PRs merged&lt;/strong&gt; • &lt;strong&gt;2200+ Code Reviews&lt;/strong&gt; • &lt;strong&gt;540+ Commits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🎓 Open Source Summer Mentor (2024)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🎤 Tech speaker at 21+ community meetups, hosted 4 plugin development series&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🏪 &lt;strong&gt;App Store Builder&lt;/strong&gt;: Built Halo App Store from 0 to 197 apps with community, curated 50+ showcase cases at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.halo.run/showcase&quot;&gt;halo.run/showcase&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ Tech Stack&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Frameworks&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Java-ED8B00?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=openjdk&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Java&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Spring_Boot-6DB33F?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=spring-boot&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Spring Boot&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=python&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Python&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-3178C6?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=typescript&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;TypeScript&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/React-20232A?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=react&amp;amp;logoColor=61DAFB&quot; alt=&quot;React&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Next.js-000000?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=next.js&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Next.js&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Vue.js-4FC08D?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=vue.js&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Vue.js&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Patterns&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DDD-Lite&lt;/strong&gt; (Domain-Driven Design)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CQRS&lt;/strong&gt; (Command Query Responsibility Segregation)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes Operator Pattern&lt;/strong&gt; (Extension/Controller/Reconciler)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monorepo&lt;/strong&gt; (pnpm + Turborepo)&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;Databases &amp;amp; Tools&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-316192?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=postgresql&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;PostgreSQL&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Redis-DC382D?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=redis&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Redis&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Docker-2496ED?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=docker&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Docker&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Kubernetes-326CE5?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=kubernetes&amp;amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Kubernetes&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/-Git-222222?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=git&amp;amp;logoColor=F05032&quot; alt=&quot;Git&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;🏆 Highlights&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;🎨 Halo 2.0 Core Architecture (2022-2025)&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;principal architect and lead designer&lt;/strong&gt; of Halo 2.0&#39;s complete rewrite:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plugin System&lt;/strong&gt; (164 PRs, 22.7%) - Designed and implemented the entire plugin architecture 
  &lt;ul&gt; 
   &lt;li&gt;🔧 Kubernetes Operator-inspired Extension/Controller/Reconciler pattern&lt;/li&gt; 
   &lt;li&gt;🔌 Plugin lifecycle management, hot-reload, extension points&lt;/li&gt; 
  &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theme System&lt;/strong&gt; (83 PRs, 11.5%) - Complete theme architecture design&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permission System&lt;/strong&gt; (63 PRs, 8.7%) - RBAC model implementation&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Indexing&lt;/strong&gt; (42 PRs) - Solved large-scale data query performance issues&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thumbnail Mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; - Extensible thumbnail generation system&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Snapshot System&lt;/strong&gt; - Version control and collaboration tracking&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
